# SAVE to a TAP through the ROM, then LOAD it back on a fresh machine.
#   ./speccy.py run examples/roundtrip.zx  -> out/roundtrip/roundtrip.tap
# With tzxtools installed, list what was saved:
#   tzxls out/roundtrip/roundtrip.tap ; tzxcat -B -b 1 out/roundtrip/roundtrip.tap
# ($OUT in a step is the script's output folder.)
enter 10 PRINT "saved and loaded"
enter 20 BORDER 4
enter SAVE "roundtrip" LINE 10
ready 200
say (the ROM says: Start tape, then press any key.)
key ENTER
ready 200
savetape roundtrip
boot
load $OUT/roundtrip.tap
wait 20
screen
